    "html": "<section class=\"slide-content\" aria-label=\"Slide 2\" aria-roledescription=\"Content\" title=\"Slide content\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:960px; height:540px;background-image: url(https://docs.google.com/presentation/u/0/d/1phTGhNljt0Lm4xdJqAllgeQ3HvWmTf9tbeTQCxQcu4U/viewpage?pageid=g30a02577f3c_0_5&amp;rev=3201&amp;hmac=ALf4PZ4IG1iNx_jj6TtwAlBP0qOHWlaJxg&amp;ts=1790569602&amp;w=960&amp;h=540&amp;format=png&amp;showText=0);\"><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:890px; height:25px; top:40px; left:42px\"><p style=\"font-weight:500;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#D9D9D9;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:16.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Introduction &amp; problem</p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:738px; height:332px; top:115px; left:108px\"><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Dashboard authors currently choose a question-based or advanced widget and configure it manually. They need a simpler way to express a custom visualization using their selected survey questions.</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Build with AI introduces a guided, prompt-based entry point. This prototype validates setup and placement only: Create widget inserts a placeholder. AI generation and backend integration are deferred.</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p><p style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">​</p></div></section>",
    "slide": "Slide 2",
    "text": "Introduction & problem\n\nDashboard authors currently choose a question-based or advanced widget and configure it manually. They need a simpler way to express a custom visualization using their selected survey questions.\n\n​\n\nBuild with AI introduces a guided, prompt-based entry point. This prototype validates setup and placement only: Create widget inserts a placeholder. AI generation and backend integration are deferred.\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​\n\n​"
  },
  {
    "html": "<section class=\"slide-content\" aria-label=\"Slide 3\" aria-roledescription=\"Content\" title=\"Slide content\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:960px; height:540px;background-image: url(https://docs.google.com/presentation/u/0/d/1phTGhNljt0Lm4xdJqAllgeQ3HvWmTf9tbeTQCxQcu4U/viewpage?pageid=g86f1215a00_0_12&amp;rev=3201&amp;hmac=ALf4PZ4IG1iNx_jj6TtwAlBP0qOHWlaJxg&amp;ts=1790569602&amp;w=960&amp;h=540&amp;format=png&amp;showText=0);\"><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:906px; height:25px; top:43px; left:43px\"><p style=\"font-weight:500;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#1B87E6;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:16.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">User journey</p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:753px; height:233px; top:133px; left:87px\"><ol class=\"list-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0 start\"><style>ol.list-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0.start { counter-reset: counter-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0 0 }ol.list-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0 > li { counter-increment: counter-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0; list-style-type: none }ol.list-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0 > li:before { content: counter(counter-kix_cuqauafe0mpv-0, decimal) \".\" \" \"}</style><li value=\"1\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Open a BI dashboard → Add widget → Build with AI.</li><li value=\"2\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Enter a widget name and click Next.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Select one survey from the survey browser.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Check one or more questions and click Next.</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Enter an optional description and click Create widget.</li><li value=\"6\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Review the placeholder in the current dashboard tab.</li><li value=\"7\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Use the three-dot menu → Settings to edit name or highlight.</li><li value=\"8\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Reuse the widget from Advanced widgets during the session.</li></ol></div></section>",
    "slide": "Slide 3",
    "text": "User journey\n\nOpen a BI dashboard → Add widget → Build with AI.\nEnter a widget name and click Next.\nSelect one survey from the survey browser.\nCheck one or more questions and click Next.\nEnter an optional description and click Create widget.\nReview the placeholder in the current dashboard tab.\nUse the three-dot menu → Settings to edit name or highlight.\nReuse the widget from Advanced widgets during the session."
  },
  {
    "html": "<section class=\"slide-content\" aria-label=\"Slide 4\" aria-roledescription=\"Content\" title=\"Slide content\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:960px; height:540px;background-image: url(https://docs.google.com/presentation/u/0/d/1phTGhNljt0Lm4xdJqAllgeQ3HvWmTf9tbeTQCxQcu4U/viewpage?pageid=g8709499aee_5_33&amp;rev=3201&amp;hmac=ALf4PZ4IG1iNx_jj6TtwAlBP0qOHWlaJxg&amp;ts=1790569602&amp;w=960&amp;h=540&amp;format=png&amp;showText=0);\"><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:890px; height:25px; top:42px; left:43px\"><p style=\"font-weight:500;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#1B87E6;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:16.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Business rules: setup</p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:752px; height:19px; top:92px; left:48px\"><p style=\"font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">One survey, multiple questions<span style=\"font-weight:400;\"></span></p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:790px; height:132px; top:131px; left:57px\"><ul class=\"list-kix_wwiq9jcs5hfj-0\"><style>ul.list-kix_wwiq9jcs5hfj-0 > li  { list-style-type: none }ul.list-kix_wwiq9jcs5hfj-0 > li:before { content: \"●\" \" \"}</style><li value=\"1\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Name is required; whitespace alone cannot advance (100 characters maximum).</li><li value=\"2\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Select exactly one survey and at least one question.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Use the shared survey picker and question table with checkboxes.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Changing the survey clears question selections; Back preserves other details.</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Description is optional and does not change the placeholder.</li><li value=\"6\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Closing the builder before creation adds nothing.</li></ul></div></section>",
    "slide": "Slide 4",
    "text": "Business rules: setup\n\nOne survey, multiple questions\n\nName is required; whitespace alone cannot advance (100 characters maximum).\nSelect exactly one survey and at least one question.\nUse the shared survey picker and question table with checkboxes.\nChanging the survey clears question selections; Back preserves other details.\nDescription is optional and does not change the placeholder.\nClosing the builder before creation adds nothing."
  },
  {
    "html": "<section class=\"slide-content\" aria-label=\"Slide 5\" aria-roledescription=\"Content\" title=\"Slide content\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:960px; height:540px;background-image: url(https://docs.google.com/presentation/u/0/d/1phTGhNljt0Lm4xdJqAllgeQ3HvWmTf9tbeTQCxQcu4U/viewpage?pageid=g86f1215a00_0_64&amp;rev=3201&amp;hmac=ALf4PZ4IG1iNx_jj6TtwAlBP0qOHWlaJxg&amp;ts=1790569602&amp;w=960&amp;h=540&amp;format=png&amp;showText=0);\"><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:854px; height:164px; top:108px; left:52px\"><ul class=\"list-kix_u8be6e4hgo5s-0\"><style>ul.list-kix_u8be6e4hgo5s-0 > li  { list-style-type: none }ul.list-kix_u8be6e4hgo5s-0 > li:before { content: \"●\" \" \"}</style><li value=\"1\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Create widget adds one placeholder to the current tab and closes the builder.</li><li value=\"2\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">No copy/paste handoff or preview checkpoint is shown.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Use the standard title, divider and three-dot menu; no AI badge above the name.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">General settings edit name and highlight text (up to 500 characters).</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Advanced widgets lists session-created widgets; reused copies have independent settings.</li><li value=\"6\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Page refresh clears widgets; server restart clears them after reconnection.</li></ul></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:890px; height:25px; top:42px; left:43px\"><p style=\"font-weight:500;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#1B87E6;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:16.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Business rules: widget &amp; session</p></div></section>",
    "slide": "Slide 5",
    "text": "Create widget adds one placeholder to the current tab and closes the builder.\nNo copy/paste handoff or preview checkpoint is shown.\nUse the standard title, divider and three-dot menu; no AI badge above the name.\nGeneral settings edit name and highlight text (up to 500 characters).\nAdvanced widgets lists session-created widgets; reused copies have independent settings.\nPage refresh clears widgets; server restart clears them after reconnection.\n\nBusiness rules: widget & session"
  },
  {
    "html": "<section class=\"slide-content\" aria-label=\"Slide 6\" aria-roledescription=\"Content\" title=\"Slide content\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:960px; height:540px;background-image: url(https://docs.google.com/presentation/u/0/d/1phTGhNljt0Lm4xdJqAllgeQ3HvWmTf9tbeTQCxQcu4U/viewpage?pageid=g86f1215898_1_32&amp;rev=3201&amp;hmac=ALf4PZ4IG1iNx_jj6TtwAlBP0qOHWlaJxg&amp;ts=1790569602&amp;w=960&amp;h=540&amp;format=png&amp;showText=0);\"><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:890px; height:25px; top:42px; left:43px\"><p style=\"font-weight:500;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#1B87E6;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:16.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Deferred scope</p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:752px; height:22px; top:89px; left:62px\"><p style=\"font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:14.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Deferred beyond this prototype<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\"></span></p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:755px; height:109px; top:129px; left:71px\"><ul class=\"list-kix_k0sz9euvib5j-0\"><style>ul.list-kix_k0sz9euvib5j-0 > li  { list-style-type: none }ul.list-kix_k0sz9euvib5j-0 > li:before { content: \"●\" \" \"}</style><li value=\"1\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Live AI calls and generated HTML, CSS or JavaScript.</li><li value=\"2\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Production API discovery, data-contract mapping and backend integration.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Filters, weight schemes, slicers and Design/Analytics/Labels tabs.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Persistent storage, custom-widget exports and shared-view integration.</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Analytical results: the current card is a placeholder only.</li></ul></div></section>",
    "slide": "Slide 6",
    "text": "Deferred scope\n\nDeferred beyond this prototype\n\nLive AI calls and generated HTML, CSS or JavaScript.\nProduction API discovery, data-contract mapping and backend integration.\nFilters, weight schemes, slicers and Design/Analytics/Labels tabs.\nPersistent storage, custom-widget exports and shared-view integration.\nAnalytical results: the current card is a placeholder only."
  },
  {
    "html": "<section class=\"slide-content\" aria-label=\"Slide 7\" aria-roledescription=\"Content\" title=\"Slide content\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:960px; height:540px;background-image: url(https://docs.google.com/presentation/u/0/d/1phTGhNljt0Lm4xdJqAllgeQ3HvWmTf9tbeTQCxQcu4U/viewpage?pageid=gfdf248c7ff_0_5&amp;rev=3201&amp;hmac=ALf4PZ4IG1iNx_jj6TtwAlBP0qOHWlaJxg&amp;ts=1790569602&amp;w=960&amp;h=540&amp;format=png&amp;showText=0);\"><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:890px; height:25px; top:42px; left:43px\"><p style=\"font-weight:500;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#1B87E6;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:16.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Scope</p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:902px; height:135px; top:87px; left:31px\"><ul class=\"list-kix_qwneimo8zxd6-0\"><style>ul.list-kix_qwneimo8zxd6-0 > li  { list-style-type: none }ul.list-kix_qwneimo8zxd6-0 > li:before { content: \"●\" \" \"}</style><li value=\"1\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Build with AI sits beside Question based and Advanced widgets.</li><li value=\"2\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Reuse the light-blue AI icon and standard modal styling.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Name → Survey → Questions → Build; no Cancel button.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Description is optional, up to 6,000 characters.</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Create a standard BI card with General settings and session reuse.</li></ul></div></section>",
    "slide": "Slide 7",
    "text": "Scope\n\nBuild with AI sits beside Question based and Advanced widgets.\nReuse the light-blue AI icon and standard modal styling.\nName → Survey → Questions → Build; no Cancel button.\nDescription is optional, up to 6,000 characters.\nCreate a standard BI card with General settings and session reuse."
