    "html": "<section class=\"slide-content\" aria-label=\"Slide 8\" aria-roledescription=\"Content\" title=\"Slide content\" style=\"overflow:hidden;width:960px; height:540px;background-image: url(https://docs.google.com/presentation/u/0/d/1phTGhNljt0Lm4xdJqAllgeQ3HvWmTf9tbeTQCxQcu4U/viewpage?pageid=gfdf248c7ff_0_0&amp;rev=3201&amp;hmac=ALf4PZ4IG1iNx_jj6TtwAlBP0qOHWlaJxg&amp;ts=1790569602&amp;w=960&amp;h=540&amp;format=png&amp;showText=0);\"><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:906px; height:25px; top:16px; left:43px\"><p style=\"font-weight:500;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#1B87E6;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:16.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Acceptance criteria</p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:752px; height:19px; top:57px; left:48px\"><p style=\"font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Prototype acceptance criteria<span style=\"font-weight:300;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;\"></span></p></div><div class=\"shape\" title=\"\" style=\"width:790px; height:132px; top:95px; left:57px\"><ul class=\"list-kix_nq552hxeqh13-0\"><style>ul.list-kix_nq552hxeqh13-0 > li  { list-style-type: none }ul.list-kix_nq552hxeqh13-0 > li:before { content: \"●\" \" \"}</style><li value=\"1\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Blank names block Next; one survey and one or more questions are required.</li><li value=\"2\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Any prompt, including blank, creates one placeholder with no extra dialog.</li><li value=\"3\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">The header matches regular widgets: name, divider and three-dot menu.</li><li value=\"4\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Settings saves a nonblank name and highlight; there is no AI header badge.</li><li value=\"5\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Advanced widgets lists the new item for reuse with independent settings.</li><li value=\"6\" style=\"font-weight:300;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;background-color:inherit;color:#666666;font-family:&quot;Fira Sans&quot;;font-size:12.0pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:left;direction:ltr;\">Refreshing clears custom widgets; existing widget creation flows remain available.</li></ul></div></section>",
    "slide": "Slide 8",
    "text": "Acceptance criteria\n\nPrototype acceptance criteria\n\nBlank names block Next; one survey and one or more questions are required.\nAny prompt, including blank, creates one placeholder with no extra dialog.\nThe header matches regular widgets: name, divider and three-dot menu.\nSettings saves a nonblank name and highlight; there is no AI header badge.\nAdvanced widgets lists the new item for reuse with independent settings.\nRefreshing clears custom widgets; existing widget creation flows remain available."
